The Cigar	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Cigar","wikiPath":"/The_Cigar","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Halas","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dok","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Everburn Candle","item":"Everburn Candle","wikiPath":"/Everburn_Candle"}],"card":{"title":"The Cigar","lines":["Minimum Level: 3","Classes: All","Related Zones: Misty Thicket","Related NPCs: bixies"]},"links":["Halas","Dok","Misty Thicket","Everburn Candle","Empty Jar","Honeycomb","Merchants of Halas","Wolves of the North","Shamen of Justice"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Dok","text":"A fine day to ye, ______. Welcome to me shop. If ye're searchin' fer a [cigar], ye won't be findin' any, more's th' pity."},{"npc":"Dok","text":"I was hoping to perfect me creation I was callin' the 'cigar', but I'm afraid I just couldn't get it right. To keep from settin' meself on fire, I switched me talents to makin' candles. I could use help from a person such as yerself. Ye could [collect the wax] fer me - the candle-makin's."},{"npc":"Dok","text":"Grreatt!! Take this wax jarr. Head to any place ye can find the wee ones they call bixies. I'm afraid ye're going to hafta bash 'em and search to find out if they're carrying any honeycombs. If they are, then ye can fill the jar with them and combine them, then return the full honeycomb jar to me. I'll be givin' ye a special candle if ye can do that fer me."},{"npc":"Dok","text":"Great work!! Now I can make more candles! Here ye are, me friend. I call this the Everburn Candle. It has a wee bit o' magic in it. I hope ye like it."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T07:40:46.683Z","outOfEra":false}
